{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/logo_optimised.gif?t=1743006931\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galago is a <strong>2D</strong>\u00a0<strong>exploration-platformer</strong>, blending <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, <strong>survival</strong>, and  <strong>mystery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the 6 <strong>golden fireflies</strong> per level. Some are <strong>hidden</strong>, others are in plain-sight, yet seemingly out of reach...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you explore, your endeavour will be hindered by\u00a0<strong>hunger</strong>, <strong>hazards\u00a0</strong>and <strong>predators</strong>. To survive, you must <strong>forage</strong> for tree sap and insects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not the galago's natural habitat \u2014 you are  in the city's <strong>wealthiest</strong> <strong>suburb</strong>. As you skitter along walls, peering through warmly lit windows, what <strong>stories</strong> might you witness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/owl_attack_1_optimised.gif?t=1743006931\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572900?t=1743006931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/dfe7eb1b56e2cf2877a0a83053d7965837fbb134/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743006931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/1b2cdb20816476904b1849fdcdf5d2714926c1d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743006931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/1b2cdb20816476904b1849fdcdf5d2714926c1d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743006931","c